<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash Jan wheat falls as harvest advances.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash Jan wheat falls as harvest advances.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine January cash wheat prices on the Buenos Aires Cereals exchange were weaker after weekend advances in harvesting, especially in the north, brought produce to the market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cash maize trade continued trading quietly in the shadow of Chicago. Soybean prices were firm on overseas demand and spot sunflower continued strong on good margins from crushers.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
